{"id":"d0dbf9d922eaa5eb","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Iteration","display":"df-zfc-forcing-iteration — ZFC Forcing Iteration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-iteration — ZFC Forcing Iteration","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-iteration — ZFC Forcing Iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md\">../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> have their standard meanings (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec P\\upharpoonright\\lambda\">\\(\\vec P\\upharpoonright\\lambda\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec Q\\upharpoonright\\lambda\">\\(\\vec Q\\upharpoonright\\lambda\\)</span> are function restrictions (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md\">../batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S(\\delta,\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec P,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec P))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec Q,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\vec P(0)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\n\\langle\\vec P(\\alpha),\\vec Q(\\alpha),\\vec P(\\alpha+1)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Step}\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\n\\langle\\lambda,\\vec P\\upharpoonright\\lambda,\\vec Q\\upharpoonright\\lambda,\\vec P(\\lambda)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Limit}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}iteration} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingIteration}_S(\\delta,\\vec P,\\vec Q,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec P,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec P))\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec Q,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec Q))\\land\n\\vec P(0)=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\n\\langle\\vec P(\\alpha),\\vec Q(\\alpha),\\vec P(\\alpha+1)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Step}\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\n\\langle\\lambda,\\vec P\\upharpoonright\\lambda,\\vec Q\\upharpoonright\\lambda,\\vec P(\\lambda)\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Limit}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Step}\">\\(\\mathsf{Step}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Limit}\">\\(\\mathsf{Limit}\\)</span> make the successor forcing operation and the chosen support policy explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep